{"seq":1,"slug":"surgical-principles","title":"大学临床医学 — 外科学总论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/surgical-principles","wordCount":1544,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-外科学总论\">大学临床医学 — 外科学总论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>外科学总论涵盖无菌技术、外科感染、创伤处理、围手术期管理和液体治疗等基本原则，是所有外科分支的共同基础。与内科&quot;药物干预&quot;不同，外科的核心手段是&quot;手术操作&quot;——但现代外科强调手术只是综合治疗链中的一环，围手术期管理（术前评估→术中操作→术后恢复）同样决定患者预后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"无菌术\">无菌术</h3><p>无菌术（aseptic technique）是外科最基本的原则，目的是防止微生物进入手术创面。三大组成部分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组分</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>关键要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灭菌法</td>\n<td>高压蒸汽灭菌（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min）、环氧乙烷灭菌</td>\n<td>手术器械、敷料必须完全灭菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消毒法</td>\n<td>化学消毒剂（碘伏、氯己定）、紫外线</td>\n<td>皮肤消毒由术野中心向外涂擦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手术操作规程</td>\n<td>外科刷手→穿无菌手术衣→戴无菌手套→铺无菌巾</td>\n<td>无菌物品不可跨越非无菌区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;打破无菌原则&quot;是手术室最严重的操作错误。无菌区域被污染后，必须更换受污染物品，严重时需重新铺巾。</p>\n<h3 id=\"外科感染\">外科感染</h3><p>外科感染可分为特异性（结核、破伤风、气性坏疽）和非特异性（化脓性感染）。</p>\n<p><strong>手术部位感染</strong>（SSI）按深度分三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>浅表切口感染</strong>：仅累及皮肤和皮下组织，术后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 天内发生</li>\n<li><strong>深部切口感染</strong>：累及深筋膜和肌层</li>\n<li><strong>器官/腔隙感染</strong>：累及手术涉及的深部器官或体腔（如腹腔脓肿）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预防 SSI 的核心措施包括：预防性抗菌药物在切皮前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> min 给药（头孢唑林为最常用选择）、缩短手术时间、维持术中正常体温（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>36</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;36°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）、严格血糖控制。</p>\n<p><strong>破伤风</strong>由破伤风梭菌产生的外毒素（痉挛毒素）引起——毒素沿运动神经轴突逆行至脊髓前角，阻断抑制性中间神经元释放甘氨酸和 GABA，导致全身骨骼肌强直性痉挛。临床表现为牙关紧闭（trismus）→苦笑面容（risus sardonicus）→角弓反张（opisthotonos）。预防重于治疗：外伤后根据免疫史决定是否注射破伤风抗毒素（TAT）或人破伤风免疫球蛋白（TIG）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"创伤与急救\">创伤与急救</h3><p>创伤评估遵循 <strong>ATLS（Advanced Trauma Life Support）</strong> 的 ABCDE 流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[A: Airway 气道] --&gt; B[B: Breathing 呼吸]&#10;    B --&gt; C[C: Circulation 循环]&#10;    C --&gt; D[D: Disability 神经功能]&#10;    D --&gt; E[E: Exposure 暴露/环境]\">graph LR\n    A[A: Airway 气道] --&gt; B[B: Breathing 呼吸]\n    B --&gt; C[C: Circulation 循环]\n    C --&gt; D[D: Disability 神经功能]\n    D --&gt; E[E: Exposure 暴露/环境]</pre><p>出血性休克按失血量分级（以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\,\\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 成人为例，总血容量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5000\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分级</th>\n<th>失血量</th>\n<th>心率</th>\n<th>血压</th>\n<th>意识</th>\n<th>液体复苏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>750</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 750\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">750</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>轻度焦虑</td>\n<td>晶体液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>750</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">750\\text{-}1500\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">750</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\text{-}30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{-}120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>焦虑</td>\n<td>晶体液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500\\text{-}2000\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>140</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120\\text{-}140</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>意识模糊</td>\n<td>晶体液 + 输血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV 级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2000\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>140</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 140</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>显著下降</td>\n<td>嗜睡/昏迷</td>\n<td>大量输血方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>液体复苏的&quot;3:1 规则&quot;：每丢失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 血液，需补充约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 等渗晶体液（如乳酸钠林格液），因为晶体液仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span> 留在血管内。但近年来&quot;损害控制复苏&quot;（damage control resuscitation）理念主张限制晶体液用量，早期启用血制品（红细胞:血浆:血小板 = 1:1:1），并允许低于正常的血压目标（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>80</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>90</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SBP \\approx 80\\text{-}90\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>），直至手术止血完成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"围手术期管理\">围手术期管理</h3><p>术前评估的核心是 <strong>ASA 分级</strong>（美国麻醉医师协会体格状态分级，I-VI 级）和心肺功能评估。对于合并心脏病的非心脏手术患者，采用 <strong>修订版心脏风险指数（RCRI）</strong> 评估围术期心血管事件风险。</p>\n<p>术后管理的早期关注点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>疼痛管理</strong>：多模式镇痛（NSAID + 弱阿片 ± 区域阻滞）优于单一阿片类，减少恶心呕吐和肠梗阻</li>\n<li><strong>静脉血栓预防</strong>：根据 Caprini 评分选择物理预防（弹力袜、间歇充气加压）或药物预防（低分子肝素）</li>\n<li><strong>营养支持</strong>：优先选择肠内营养（经口或鼻胃管），肠道功能不可用时才选择肠外营养</li>\n<li><strong>加速康复外科（ERAS）</strong>：术前不长时间禁食（清液 2 h）、微创手术、早期下床活动、早期经口进食</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位建筑工人被生锈铁钉扎伤足底，伤口深而窄。他不记得上次注射破伤风疫苗的时间。请制定破伤风预防方案，并解释为什么深窄伤口比浅表擦伤更易发生破伤风。</li>\n<li>一位腹部手术后第 5 天的患者出现切口红肿、压痛和脓性渗出。请判断 SSI 的级别，并说明处理原则。</li>\n<li>一位车祸伤患者，估计失血 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1800</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1800\\,\\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1800</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，心率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span></span></span></span></span> bpm，血压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85/50\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85/50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>。请判断休克分级，并比较传统晶体液复苏与损害控制复苏策略的差异。</li>\n<li>ERAS 的核心理念是什么？列举至少 3 个具体措施，并分析它们分别针对围术期的哪些应激反应。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Schwartz&#39;s Principles of Surgery</strong>：外科学经典教材，总论部分详尽覆盖无菌术、创伤和休克。</li>\n<li><strong>ATLS Student Course Manual</strong>（ACS 编著）：创伤急救的全球标准课程，推荐系统性学习。</li>\n<li><strong>WHO Surgical Safety Checklist</strong>：世界卫生组织手术安全核查表，是手术室安全文化的基础文件。</li>\n<li><strong>ERAS Society Guidelines</strong>（erassociety.org）：加速康复外科各专科指南合集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>外科学总论的核心是&quot;安全&quot;——无菌术保证手术创面不受污染，感染防控减少 SSI 发生率，创伤急救的 ABCDE 流程确保不遗漏致命性损伤，围手术期管理将手术风险降至最低。现代外科的趋势是从&quot;手术中心&quot;转向&quot;患者中心&quot;，ERAS 理念和损害控制策略都体现了这一转变：不追求最大化的手术操作，而是追求最优化的整体预后。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 外科学总论","id":"大学临床医学-外科学总论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"无菌术","id":"无菌术"},{"level":3,"text":"外科感染","id":"外科感染"},{"level":3,"text":"创伤与急救","id":"创伤与急救"},{"level":3,"text":"围手术期管理","id":"围手术期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 内分泌与代谢疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/endocrine-metabolic"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 骨科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/orthopedic-surgery"}}